<view class="page"><view class="title">会员充值</view><view wx:for="{{packages}}" wx:key="id" class="package"><text class="name">{{item.name}}</text><view class="amount"><text>支付 ¥{{item.payText}}</text><text>合计到账 ¥{{item.totalText}}</text></view><text class="bonus">储值 ¥{{item.storedText}}<text wx:if="{{item.bonus}}"> + 赠金 ¥{{item.bonusText}}</text></text></view><view wx:if="{{!packages.length}}" class="empty">暂无储值套餐</view><view class="notice">线上充值暂未开放，请到收银处办理。实际到账以收银确认的记录为准。</view></view>
